  "name": "Normal world: Green Meadow (ground)",
  "notes": "The Normal world's ground, a green meadow (world 0, the first of the 9 worlds; the run picks one at random). The 3x3-screen world (90x60 tiles), one wide open field: nothing inside blocks the player or the monsters. Only the 3-tile band of deep forest around the edge is solid, so nobody can leave the map. Inside there are only things you walk over: grass with no roads; sandy clearings (the path pieces) shaped as circles, ovals and rectangles of different sizes, spread over the whole field (a round one where the player starts); tall grass patches and flower beds in between; and the Alpha's stone circle lying in the grass in the south-east. Water, trees, rocks, fences, ledges, walls, pillars and graves are not used.",
